  "notable_quotes": [
    "Simulations indicate carbonate pillars in Zn2(atz)2(CO3) significantly and directly participate in binding CO2 molecules.",
    "The water tolerance observed here is consistent with the design principle that short-linker ultramicroporous MOFs tend to be more stable in water.",
    "The MOF has a moderate CO2 isosteric heat of 37.5 kJ mol−1 at near-zero coverage and an IAST CO2/N2 selectivity of 188 at 298 K, 100 kPa."
